Example: Writing with Specific Field Names (Dictionary Style)
If you're dealing with dictionaries, use the DictWriter class:

python
import csv

# Sample data as dictionaries
data = [
    {"Name": "Alice", "Age": 25, "City": "New York"},
    {"Name": "Bob", "Age": 30, "City": "Los Angeles"},
    {"Name": "Charlie", "Age": 35, "City": "Chicago"}
]

# Open a file to write CSV data
